**
** 2D Base-Isolated Frame - Bouc-Wen UEL
** v9: Full Rayleigh damping via DASHPOT1 elements
** Mass-proportional: dashpots from floor nodes to ground (C=alpha_m * m_i)
** Stiffness-proportional at isolators: dashpots across isolators (C=beta_k * k0)
** Material Rayleigh damping on steel frame for frame modes
